isn't always easy.

00:00:30.270 --> 00:00:31.830
CRAIG LABENZ:
Martin, when I say--

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:33.695
I feel you on that.

00:00:33.695 --> 00:00:35.820
But luckily I've been
working on a Terraform script

00:00:35.820 --> 00:00:38.400
to automate the
entire process on GCP.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:40.906
Want to test it out
on your project?

00:00:40.906 --> 00:00:42.970
MARTIN OMANDER: Yeah,
that would be amazing!

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:44.391
Show me the way.

00:00:44.391 --> 00:00:47.337
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:54.148 --> 00:00:55.940
CRAIG LABENZ: I've been
using and deploying

00:00:55.940 --> 00:00:57.650
Django for over a decade.

00:00:57.650 --> 00:01:00.880
And honestly, it's
tricky every time.

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:02.630
MARTIN OMANDER: That
makes me feel better,

00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:04.160
to hear you say that.

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:06.380
There are a lot of tedious
