application secrets.

00:01:16.550 --> 00:01:18.530
It's not easy to
get all that right.

00:01:18.530 --> 00:01:21.860
Now, Cloud Run is serverless, so
it can handle the scaling part.

00:01:21.860 --> 00:01:24.370
But the rest are
still a challenge.

00:01:24.370 --> 00:01:26.210
MARTIN OMANDER: And
your script handles

00:01:26.210 --> 00:01:29.150
